Package: iteviz
Title: ABIM Pass Estimates from ITE Scores, and Their Display
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Fred", "Buckhold", email = "fbuckhold3@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9049-3870"))
Description: R mirror of the im-ite-analyzer nomogram (ite_core/nomogram.py):
    the estimated chance of passing the ABIM certification exam from IM-ITE
    percent correct and PGY level, approximating the McDonald et al. (2020)
    curves <doi:10.1097/ACM.0000000000003382>. Risk tiers, ~5% display labels,
    trajectories and curves match the Python spec exactly (checked against a
    shared parity fixture). Also provides htmltools/plotly display helpers:
    tier badge, estimate card, per-year chips and the nomogram chart.
